  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addameer is the leading Palestinian
prisoners&#x2019; rights association. Addameer
assists prisoners and their families through
the provision of free legal advice and
representation in Israeli military courts,
seeking to guarantee minimum rights
where possible and, where not, raising
awareness and lobbying for change in
practices. It focuses on violations by both
the Israeli and Palestinian authorities</narrative>
